[29.243589, "o", "    \"roles\": [\"admin\", \"editor\"]  # Array of roles assigned to the user (may be empty)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   },\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ...\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ]\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> **Output Data Schema**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> The output JSON file '\"'\"'/app/active_users_report.json'\"'\"' must be an array of objects with the following structure:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> [\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   {\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     \"user_id\": 1,                 # Derived from '\"'\"'id'\"'\"' in input \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     \"username\": \"john_doe\",       # Retained from input \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
