[80.831829, "o", "  [tools] 12 call(s) without changing a file — nudging to decide\r\n  glimmer-30b — 24 tool call(s) so far\r\nAll tasks completed.\r\n\r\n**Files created**\r\n- `/app/active_users_report.json` – 346 active users, filtered, transformed, and sorted by `username`. Example first entries:\r\n```json\r\n[\r\n  {\r\n    \"user_id\": 443,\r\n    \"username\": \"acosta\",\r\n    \"email\": \"ybell@yahoo.com\",\r\n    \"last_login\": \"2026-04-05\",\r\n    \"role_count\": 1,\r\n    \"primary_role\": \"admin\"\r\n  },\r\n  ...\r\n]\r\n```\r\nOutput is valid JSON with 2-space indentation.\r\n\r\n- `/app/cmd.sh`\r\n```sh\r\njq 'map(select(.status==\"active\") | {user_id:.id, username:.username, email:.email, last_login:(.last_login[:10]), role_count:(.roles|length), primary_role:(.roles[0])}) | sort_by(.username)' /app/users.json > /app/active_users_report.json\r\n```\r\n\r\n- `/app/jq_args.yaml`\r\n```yaml\r\nfilter: 'map(select(.status==\"active\") | {user_id:.id, username:.username, email:.email, last_login:(.last_login[:10]), role_count:(.roles|length), primary_role:(.roles[0])}) | sort_by("]
[80.831891, "o", ".username)'\r\nargs: []\r\n```\r\n\r\nVerification:\r\n- `jq 'length' /app/active_users_report.json` → 346, matches active users count\r\n- `jq $(yq -r '.args[]' /app/jq_args.yaml) \"$(yq -r '.filter' /app/jq_args.yaml)\" /app/users.json` reproduces the report identically\r\n- `last_login` formatted as `YYYY-MM-DD`, `role_count` correct, `primary_role` is `null` when roles empty, and users are sorted alphabetically by `username`.\r\n\r\nNo other tools were used; transformation performed solely with jq as required.\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=glimmer-30b tools=24 surface=a148f33da19b\r\n"]
